  "description": "SQLDBEntityNotifier is a .NET library for SQL Server change tracking notifications, designed for use with Entity Framework Core and dependency injection. It provides event-driven notifications for insert, update, delete, and error scenarios, supporting both in-memory and real SQL Server databases. Easy to use, well-documented, and fully unit tested.",
